# The published list of the units the upfront compilation compiles (UnitSelectionOption), the field of entry_options/compilation_place's upfront: whole_program, the program as one unit, its rounds run on each point; let_bound_closure, the function a program's top-level let binds (gezi.narrowblocks.BoundFunctionUnit), compiled once per configuration into the cache service and replaced in each point by its artifact (gezi.narrowblocks.ClosureUnits), a program with no such let compiled whole.
# A Scott sum whose constructors are the tuple's fields, in the order of the
# enum's cases; an entry.lambdalattice imports this file and writes a
# constructor, and EntryData reads which alternative it takes by structure
# (gezi.contest.entry.EntryData, THE OPTIONS AS SCOTT CONSTRUCTORS).
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λwhole_program let_bound_closure. whole_program)
λ whole_program
. (λtuple. tuple λwhole_program let_bound_closure. let_bound_closure)
λ let_bound_closure
. export whole_program let_bound_closure
